# `project let, true` reports the syntax errors only.
mode: check
schema: 'orders.csv'(orderId: string, customerId: string, amount: real, qty: long, small: int, timestamp: datetime, wait: timespan, shipped: bool)
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | project let, true
---- expected
error[DS0101]: expected an expression after `project`, found `let`
  --> query:1:29
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | project let, true
  |                             ^^^

error[DS0101]: expected a name after `let`, found `,`
  --> query:1:32
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | project let, true
  |                                ^
